{
  "name": "startup-tech-deploy",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fields": {
          "values": [
            { "name": "version", "display": true },
            { "name": "environment", "display": true }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "1",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://localhost:3000/api/deploy/checklist",
        "method": "POST",
        "body": {
          "body": [
            { "name": "version", "value": "={{$json.version}}" },
            { "name": "environment", "value": "={{$json.environment}}" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "2",
      "name": "Checklist Pré-Déploiement",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [420, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "prompt": "Tu es un DevOps engineer. Vérifie la checklist de pré-déploiement suivante.\n\nVersion: {{$json.version}}\nEnvironnement: {{$json.environment}}\nChecklist: {{JSON.stringify($json.checklist)}}\n\nVérifie:\n1. Tous les tests passent (unit, integration, e2e)\n2. Pas de secrets dans le code\n3. Changelog à jour\n4. Migration DB validée\n5. Rollback plan documenté\n6. Monitoring/alertes configurés\n7. Variables d'environnement prêtes\n\nRéponds en JSON:\n{\n  \"go_nogo\": \"go|nogo|conditional\",\n  \"blockers\": [...],\n  \"warnings\": [...],\n  \"score\": number (0-100)\n}\n\nIMPORTANT: Tu es un assistant. La décision Go/No-Go finale est HUMAINE.",
        "temperature": 0.2,
        "maxTokens": 1500,
        "options": {
          "responseFormat": "json_object"
        }
      },
      "id": "3",
      "name": "LLM Vérification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [640, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            { "value1": "={{JSON.parse($json.message.content).go_nogo}}", "operation": "equals", "value2": "go" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "4",
      "name": "Go/No-Go?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [860, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.github.com/repos/{{$json.repo}}/git/refs/tags",
        "method": "POST",
        "headers": {
          "headers": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{$credentials.githubToken}}" }
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "body": [
            { "name": "ref", "value": "=refs/tags/{{$json.version}}" },
            { "name": "sha", "value": "={{$json.sha}}" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "5",
      "name": "Tag Release GitHub",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1100, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "channel": "#deployments",
        "text": "=✅ **GO for deploy** v{{$json.version}} → {{$json.environment}}\nScore: {{JSON.parse($json.message.content).score}}/100\n\n⚠️ Note: L'IA recommande Go. La décision finale reste humaine.",
        "credentials": "slack_api"
      },
      "id": "6",
      "name": "Slack Go Notification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1320, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "channel": "#deployments",
        "text": "=🛑 **NO-GO** for deploy v{{$json.version}} → {{$json.environment}}\n\nBlockers: {{JSON.stringify(JSON.parse($json.message.content).blockers)}}\nWarnings: {{JSON.stringify(JSON.parse($json.message.content).warnings)}}",
        "credentials": "slack_api"
      },
      "id": "7",
      "name": "Slack No-Go Notification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1100, 400]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Checklist Pré-Déploiement", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Checklist Pré-Déploiement": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "LLM Vérification", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "LLM Vérification": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Go/No-Go?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Go/No-Go?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Tag Release GitHub", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Slack No-Go Notification", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Tag Release GitHub": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Slack Go Notification", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "versionId": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000002",
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": true,
    "instanceId": "startup-tech"
  },
  "tags": [
    { "name": "startup-tech" },
    { "name": "deploy" },
    { "name": "go-nogo" }
  ]
}
